          "level": "preferred",
          "summary": "Add maintenance renewal mechanics: 12-month renewals, 30-day customer opt-out, 60-day vendor reminder, uplift capped at lesser of CPI and 3%",
          "comment": "[Playbook] Section 10 makes the maintenance term \"renewable\" but is silent on how renewal happens, on the notice we must give and on renewal pricing, so we have added standard mechanics: successive twelve-month renewals, a thirty-day opt-out for us, a sixty-day renewal reminder from Garman, and a renewal uplift capped at the lesser of CPI and 3%. If a hard cap is difficult we can accept a 5% ceiling with a sixty-day non-renewal window.",
