              "kind": "insert_after",
              "paragraphId": "p0082",
              "numbering": "(d)",
              "text": "(d) MAINTENANCE TERM AND RENEWAL\n\nThe maintenance term shall renew automatically for successive twelve (12) month terms unless Sparkling gives Garman written notice of non-renewal at least thirty (30) calendar days before the end of the then-current maintenance term. Garman shall notify Sparkling in writing of the upcoming renewal, and of the maintenance fees proposed for the renewal term, at least sixty (60) calendar days before the end of the then-current maintenance term. Maintenance fees for any renewal term shall not exceed the fees for the then-current term by more than the lesser of (i) the percentage increase in the Consumer Price Index over the then-current term and (ii) three percent (3%)."
